{"read_id": "READ-20261116-da24a5", "session_id": "SESSION-20261116-7df206", "target": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261116-b90457"}, "reading": "summarized", "note": "学習の先天的受け皿を、書評2本の記述から要約した。本文は未取得。", "created_at": "2026-11-16T04:20:00Z"}
